{% layout none %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Founder OS — OFFCOMFRT</title>
{% comment %}
  OFFCOMFRT — Founder OS
  Full founder operating dashboard (tasks, projects, departments, meetings,
  decisions, delegation, goals, weekly reviews, personal log).
  Frontend: this Shopify page. Data: Supabase via the Render backend
  (GET/PUT /api/founder-os/state), with a login gate using the admin password.
  Deploy: save as templates/page.founder-os.liquid, upload founder-os.js to
  theme assets, then assign the template to a page. See
  FOUNDER_OS_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md in the repo.
{% endcomment %}
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script crossorigin src="https://unpkg.com/react@18.3.1/umd/react.production.min.js"></script>
<script crossorigin src="https://unpkg.com/react-dom@18.3.1/umd/react-dom.production.min.js"></script>
<script crossorigin src="https://unpkg.com/prop-types@15.8.1/prop-types.min.js"></script>
<script crossorigin src="https://unpkg.com/recharts@2.12.7/umd/Recharts.js"></script>
<style>
  html, body { background: #fafaf9; margin: 0; }
  #fos-boot {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh; font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #a8a29e;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app"><div id="fos-boot">Loading Founder OS…</div></div>
<script src="{{ 'founder-os.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
